          <p>Sticking doors, worn hinges, and locks that need adjusting or swapping.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-card">
          <div class="badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="10" rx="1.6"/><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M5.5 5.5l2 2M18.5 5.5l-2 2M5.5 18.5l2-2M18.5 18.5l-2-2"/></svg></div>
